1
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:09,000
The true story of two sisters who shared a passion, a madness, and a man.

2
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Hilary and Jackie is a drama, music film directed by Anand Tucker.

3
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:15,000
The tragic story of world-renowned cellist Jacqueline du Pré, as told from
the point of view of her sister, flautist Hilary du Pré-Finzi.

4
